            "title": "Sun Communities (SUI) Q3 2025 Earnings Transcript",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Charles Young: Good afternoon, and thank you for joining us on today's third quarter earnings call.  This is my first earnings call as Chief Executive Officer of Sun, and I want to start by saying how excited I am to be a part of this exceptional team.  My first few weeks reaffirmed what drove me to Sun, the strength of our teams, the scale of the platform, the quality of our communities and the opportunity in front of us.",
